**Title:** Whispering Waves: A Sleepy Shoreline Tale

**Description:** Immerse yourself in a serene bedtime journey with Sam, an eleven-year-old boy whose quiet bravery guides him along the gentle rhythms of a coastal shoreline. Joined by his playful otter companion, Finn, Sam strolls the sandy edges where the ocean meets the land. Together, they discover the tranquil beauty of the setting sun and the soothing whispers of the sea breeze. This calming narrative is crafted to lull you into a peaceful sleep, easing anxiety and nurturing inner calm, as it invites your mind to wander into the dreamy embrace of nature’s gentle lullaby.

